      "content": "That's a good start. Can you expand on the \"sovereign individual\" part? Specifically, how would a philosopher argue that the government doesn't have the moral legitimacy to decide what is \"harmful\" or \"misinformation\" on a platform? I want to make the case that the state is inherently unqualified to be the arbiter of truth.",
